## Files Description

- **`notebooks/analysis.ipynb`**: Complete analysis workflow with code, visualizations, and narrative
- **`requirements.txt`**: Python package dependencies
- **`presentation/slides.pdf`**: 5-slide presentation summarizing the project
- **`data/`**: Data files (note: large files may be stored separately or gitignored)

