## Dynamic Pricing Recommendations

[This section can include high-level recommendations such as:]
- Implement surge pricing during peak demand hours (6-9 PM weekdays)
- Apply distance-based tiering with multipliers for long-distance deliveries
- Weather-based adjustments for extreme conditions
- Competitive monitoring to ensure market alignment

